  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(\u00acX\u2228Y)\u2227Z?$",
  "worked_solution": "We distribute the conjunction over the disjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(\u00acX\u2228Y)\u2227Z\u2261(\u00acX\u2227Z)\u2228(Y\u2227Z)\n$$\n\nNow, since $Y\u2227Z\u2261Z\u2227Y,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(\u00acX\u2227Z)\u2228(Y\u2227Z)\u2261(\u00acX\u2227Z)\u2228(Z\u2227Y).\n$$",
